  "summary": "RAID log follows the Deloitte Excel template on a single detail sheet: Risks, Actions, Issues, and Decisions are side-by-side sections. Risks include probability, impact, risk rating, risk appetite, and a response priority. Actions, issues, and decisions use High, Moderate, or Low priority. Each item labels whether the owner is on the Client, Consultant, or Joint side.",
